[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3615813330","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113401#issuecomment-3615813330","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113401","id":3615813330,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XhO7S","user":{"login":"BrotherShort","id":129957860,"node_id":"U_kgDOB77_5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129957860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort","html_url":"https://github.com/BrotherShort","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-05T08:33:34Z","updated_at":"2025-12-05T08:39:11Z","body":"There are 2 spacer controls on 2 sides of the center buttons. They keep center buttons centered.\nAfter created, their `custom_minimum_size`s will be set values which are based on the widths of the left menu and right buttons.\nCode is here:\n\n<img width=\"1529\" height=\"601\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce6b3841-d4e8-4e93-b098-7fc107f5d222\" />\n\nHowever, `project_run_bar->get_minimum_size()` `right_menu_hb->get_minimum_size()` are inaccurate.\nThe real values:\n\n<img width=\"1031\" height=\"207\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31700bb5-449f-4aed-8a3f-9bed87689e11\" />\n\nComputing values:\n\n<img width=\"1360\" height=\"61\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61429818-cb2b-490e-9ce4-212fb3685643\" />\n\nSo spacer controls `custom_minimum_size`s are inaccurate, too.\n\nCan we change from `get_minimum_size()` to `get_size()`?\nNo, the GUI hasn't been rendered yet, so the `size` values are 0.\n\nI think we should move the calculation in the update function.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3615813330/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]